{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那就麻烦喊口号了，那个……”", "text_idx": 442, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 446, "voice": "mc0346", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "老师故意不看濑名同学，而是向我投来求救的眼神。", "text_idx": 469, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "明明濑名同学的气势跟以前比已经柔和许多了，她还是很怕跟她说话的样子。", "text_idx": 458, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然我也想帮她……", "text_idx": 471, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“起立！！”", "text_idx": 432, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0219", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“敬礼！”", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“辛、辛苦了！”", "text_idx": 434, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 446, "voice": "mc0347", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "老师连忙低下头。", "text_idx": 470, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一进入下课时间，教室中立刻充满喧闹声。", "text_idx": 445, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，抱歉。有一件事我忘记说了……”", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 446, "voice": "mc0348", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那个～各位～请听我说～”", "text_idx": 441, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 446, "voice": "mc0349", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "老师很困扰的样子。", "text_idx": 468, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "没办法。", "text_idx": 462, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“大家──”", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“还有事情要宣布，大家请安静。”", "text_idx": 435, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar5507", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不愧是她……", "text_idx": 448, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "没有大喊大叫，只是自然地说话而已，就让吵闹的教室立刻寂静无声。", "text_idx": 463, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那个，因为快到期末考了，各位请努力用功喔！”", "text_idx": 440, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 446, "voice": "mc0350", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“考试范围在课堂上讲过了，还不知道的人请来问我。”", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 446, "voice": "mc0351", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“要说的就是以上吗？”", "text_idx": 427, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar5508", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是、是的，这样就说完了。”", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 446, "voice": "mc0352", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "万智老师逃跑般离开教室。", "text_idx": 447, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……还是一样呢。”", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ht1128", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太走到我的座位旁，看向老师离开的门。", "text_idx": 474, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“她讲课很容易懂也很有趣，稍微有点自信也可以的说……”", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是啊。如果声音能再大声一点，比较容易听到就太好了。”", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ht1129", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为个性使然吧。”", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果是这层意思，濑名同学或许很适合当老师。”", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ht1130", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“为什么你觉得我适合？”", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar5509", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学调侃地问。", "text_idx": 464, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“说人人到，濑名同学耳朵真好呢。”", "text_idx": 429, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ht1131", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太苦笑一下。", "text_idx": 473, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“应该不是因为我是学园长的女儿这种理由吧？”", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar5510", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“跟那个没关系吧。”", "text_idx": 433, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就像刚才，你一句话就让教室安静下来了吧？”", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ht1132", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“说有事要宣布，大家就会听了吧？”", "text_idx": 430, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar5511", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我觉得不是那个原因……”", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ht1133", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是吗？毕竟跟期末考有关，要是没听到吃亏的还是自己不是吗？”", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar5512", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“感觉时间过得好快呢。”", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不久前才觉得合并试办刚开始而已，现在已经到期末了。”", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ht1134", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……说的也是呢。”", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么了，你很少这样紧张的感觉耶。”", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ht1135", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“该不会是玩过头了？”", "text_idx": 428, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar5513", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我没有玩，我都有在念书的……”", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“颗颗颗，呼哈哈哈哈哈！”", "text_idx": 443, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 467, "voice": "sn2186", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“终于、终于等到剥掉瓜生骗人面具的时刻了！”", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 467, "voice": "sn2187", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“剥掉骗人面具？”", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ht1136", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“瓜生的面具戴得很牢固还黏很紧对吧？”", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 467, "voice": "sn2188", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以我要亲手把它剥下来！”", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 467, "voice": "sn2189", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么剥？”", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“期末考等着看吧！这次我要用压倒性的差距把你比下去！”", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 467, "voice": "sn2190", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "乾同学气势如虹地指着我。", "text_idx": 450, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……请手下留情。”", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我会尽全力不会客气的，你放心吧！”", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 467, "voice": "sn2191", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……我不是那个意思。”", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好了，那就赶快回家用功──之前得去美羽学姐那里呢！”", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 467, "voice": "sn2192", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“再见！”", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 467, "voice": "sn2193", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "乾同学很快就跑走了。", "text_idx": 449, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……她想说什么呢？”", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ht1137", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“应该是想说考试彼此都加油吧？”", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真是不坦率啊，小乾。”", "text_idx": 422, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ht1138", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是啊。”", "text_idx": 410, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar5514", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……不过，这次没有来呢。”", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“什么没来？”", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar5515", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“每次这样聊天时，安洁好像都会突然出现……”", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你这么一说……好像是。如果她加入聊天，我本来想像期中考时一样彻底指导她的说。”", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar5516", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我好像知道安洁没来的理由了。", "text_idx": 455, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“先不说安洁，你这次怎么样？”", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar5517", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“应该没问题，我会自己努力的。”", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我知道了，那就彼此加油吧。”", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar5518", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“虽然问题解决了，但立刻就遇到考试啊。时机点真糟糕。”", "text_idx": 426, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ht1139", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“时机？”", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“两个人的时间都要被考试占去了。”", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ht1140", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是啊。”", "text_idx": 410, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……你很坦然呢。”", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ht1141", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为我们决定不勉强自己。”", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“照自己的步调慢慢前进就好了。”", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……那样好像比较好。”", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ht1142", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哥哥。”", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": "sk3056", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃来到我们的教室。", "text_idx": 461, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我现在过去。”", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯。”", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": "sk3057", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁想过了！”", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 451, "voice": "ag3574", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“逃跑也是没用的话，一开始乖乖被逮就好了对吧？”", "text_idx": 439, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 451, "voice": "ag3575", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“比起考试时后悔，趁现在熬过恐惧伤口会比较浅才对！”", "text_idx": 418, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 451, "voice": "ag3576", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“两边都是伤痕累累？”", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": "sk3058", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……什么意思啊？”", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar5519", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯。安洁也要一起用功是吧？欢迎你喔！”", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是的，那就接受你的好意了！”", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 451, "voice": "ag3577", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“葛格，四个人怎么办？”", "text_idx": 425, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": "sk3059", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“女孩子比较多，去樱乃的房间可以吗？”", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯。我有整理过了。”", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": "sk3060", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“抱歉，因为安洁突然来打扰……”", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 451, "voice": "ag3578", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“大家一起用功就不可怕了。”", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": "sk3061", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“说的也是呢！现在要好好用功准备考试才行！”", "text_idx": 431, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 451, "voice": "ag3579", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“之前低空飞过了。这次一定也可以！”", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 451, "voice": "ag3580", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没错。安洁要成为肯努力就办得到的女仆！”", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 451, "voice": "ag3581", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁在胸口握拳展示决心。", "text_idx": 452, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁，比起肯努力就办得到的女仆，随时都能办到的女仆比较好不是吗？”", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar5520", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为那个现在有点难，所以从能做到的事开始一步一脚印！”", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 451, "voice": "ag3582", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“感觉是积极地消极呢。”", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……好吧，那就开始了。”", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar5521", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我吃饱了。”", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不客气，只是简单的东西！”", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 451, "voice": "ag3583", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这里厨房很大真好呢。”", "text_idx": 438, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar5522", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是的，可以三个人一起动手，很方便做料理呢。”", "text_idx": 413, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 451, "voice": "ag3584", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，大家一起做好开心。”", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": "sk3062", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“刚才麻烦你们煮菜了，收拾就交给我吧。”", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这一点请放心！已经几乎都收拾好了！”", "text_idx": 436, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 451, "voice": "ag3585", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“只剩下用的碗盘而已。”", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar5523", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……真厉害。”", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为有樱乃学妹、爱理同学。”", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 451, "voice": "ag3586", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁在这里感觉身为女仆派不上用场，有点沮丧。”", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 451, "voice": "ag3587", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么会，你真的帮了很多忙。”", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "料理和收拾当然也是，但她一定做了更多。", "text_idx": 456, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“感觉家里到处都变干净了，是安洁打扫的吧？”", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是的！安洁有特地偷偷做，没想到还是被发现了，安洁的修行还不够。”", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 451, "voice": "ag3588", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我还想说你有时候会跑不见，原来是去做那些事了？”", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar5524", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“想、想说用功的时候也需要转换心情，感觉怎么样呢？”", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 451, "voice": "ag3589", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我懂。考试期间房间总是干干净净。”", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": "sk3063", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好吧，我也懂你的心情，而且今天的目标也达成了。”", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar5525", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“明天呢？”", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": "sk3064", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“抱歉。我或许会有事，明天再决定好吗？”", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar5526", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，我知道了。”", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": "sk3065", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁呢？”", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁配合爱理同学的预定。”", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 451, "voice": "ag3590", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这样吗？”", "text_idx": 437, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是的，因为不想打扰两位。”", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 451, "voice": "ag3591", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们互看一眼，安洁对我微笑。", "text_idx": 454, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
